  "question": {
    "text": "A helicopter rises from rest on the ground vertically upwards with a constant acceleration g. A food packet is dropped from the helicopter when it is at a height h. The time taken by the packet to reach the ground is close to [<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is the acceleration due to gravity]:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mfenced><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mfenced><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mfenced><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0107_702cac1f32e3.png\" style=\"width: 183px; height: 271px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>For upward motion of helicopter</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;Now particle will start moving under gravity.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo></math><br />&nbsp;</p>"
  }
